{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## Both changes MERGED to main; live harness dispatched\n\n**Gerrit 1399 (9f26)** and **1400 (4b9e)** are both `LLM-Review +1`, `Verified +1`, and **MERGED**.\nOn `origin/main` as `95c535d4be` and `c3fb869ab5`. **1398 (the defective patchset) is ABANDONED.**\n\nLive harness dispatched at `c3fb869ab5` — **run `30964805133`** — which is the only place the\nthree cells run. Result to be recorded here.\n\nThe three cells and what each must now show:\n\n| cell | was | must now |\n|---|---|---|\n| `test_inbound_set_parent_round_trips` (renamed) | `NotImplementedError` at the SETUP line | GREEN — an Epic Link parent set on the instance reaches `.parent_id` |\n| `test_outbound_unrepresentable_parent_is_REPORTED_rather_than_silently_dropped` (renamed) | `NotImplementedError` at the mutation | GREEN — a bridge alert names the drop AND the instance is unwritten |\n| `test_outbound_clear_parent_round_trips` | `AssertionError` — sub-task parent survived | GREEN — the Epic Link clears through a pass |\n\n**Still not closing.** The acceptance criteria are verified by the harness, not by me asserting it."},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1785891347056258001,"uuid":"14063b74-742c-4273-a184-5f6f2ee65b28"}